<fo:bookmark internal-destination="ch-math"><fo:bookmark-title>10　数式 (MathML)</fo:bookmark-title><fo:bookmark internal-destination="s-10-1"><fo:bookmark-title>10.1　mfrac・msqrt・msup (二次方程式の解の公式)</fo:bookmark-title></fo:bookmark><fo:bookmark internal-destination="s-10-2"><fo:bookmark-title>10.2　munderover・mtable (総和と行列)</fo:bookmark-title></fo:bookmark><fo:bookmark internal-destination="s-10-3"><fo:bookmark-title>10.3　行の中の数式</fo:bookmark-title></fo:bookmark></fo:bookmark>
