  <!-- ================================================================ 本文 -->
  <fo:page-sequence master-reference="book" initial-page-number="1">
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-odd"><fo:block text-align="end" end-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="chapter" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/>　|　<fo:page-number/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-even"><fo:block text-align="start" start-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:page-number/>　|　Kumiori 対応仕様説明書 — XSL-FO 1.1 編</fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-odd"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-odd" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-even"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-even" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator"><fo:block line-height="1" padding-after="2pt"><fo:leader leader-pattern="rule" leader-length="30mm" rule-thickness="0.5pt" color="#6b7275"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" text-align="justify">

      <!-- ──────────────── 1 はじめに -->
      <fo:block id="ch-intro" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">はじめに</fo:marker><!--tab:1--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="0.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">1</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="0.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">1</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">1</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">はじめに</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Kumiori (組み織り) は、XSL-FO と HTML・CSS から PDF を作る組版の処理系です。この文書は、XSL-FO 1.1 の要素とプロパティのうち、文書を組むときによく使うものを取り上げ、Kumiori がそれをどう扱うかを、実際に組んだ例で示します。項目ごとに、次のものを並べます。</fo:block>
      <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="5mm" provisional-label-separation="2mm" space-before="2mm" space-after="2mm">
        <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block color="#b5562b">●</fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>プロパティの定義 (節の見出しの下の小さな文字の行)。XSL 1.1 §7 の表の「Value」「Initial」「Inherited」を原文のまま載せ、あわせて仕様の原文 (英語) を節番号を添えて引用します。</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
        <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block color="#b5562b">●</fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Kumiori での扱い (対応状況と説明)</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
        <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block color="#b5562b">●</fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Kumiori で組んだ例 (細い枠の中) と、その見本のコード (その下の灰色の背景。黄色の背景の太字が、その節で取り上げる指定)</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
      </fo:list-block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">組版例と見本のコードは、同じ原文から作っています。原稿 (docs/conformance/fo/kumiori-xsl-fo.fo) に一度だけ書いた見本を組版例として組み、そのコードの表示を後に差し込みます。同じ見本を、Kumiori のテスト (test/conformance.test.ts) でも 1 つずつ組んで確かめています。</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">「対応」「一部」「未対応」は、次のように確かめました。要素やプロパティを指定した文書と指定しない文書を Kumiori で読み込み、組版に渡す中身 (論理的な木) を比べます。中身が変わらず、読み込み処理がその名前を解釈しないものを未対応としました (第 13 章)。中身が変わるものは、組版例で仕様のとおりに組めていることを目で確かめています。</fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-1-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">1.1　</fo:inline>対応状況</fo:block>
      <fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="8.5pt">
        <fo:table-column column-width="22mm"/>
        <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
        <fo:table-body>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block><fo:inline background-color="#2e7d4f" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5pt" padding="0.5pt 3pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>仕様のとおりに組む。</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block><fo:inline background-color="#b7791f" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5pt" padding="0.5pt 3pt">一部</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>主な使い方には対応するが、扱わない値や組み合わせがある (説明に書く)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block><fo:inline background-color="#8a8a8a" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5pt" padding="0.5pt 3pt">未対応</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>無視する (要素の中のテキストは、できるかぎり組版する)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
        </fo:table-body>
      </fo:table>

      <fo:block id="s-1-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">1.2　</fo:inline>組んだ環境</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">この文書は、Kumiori のコマンドの既定 (<fo:inline font-family="monospace" keep-together.within-line="always">--compat spec</fo:inline>。XSL-FO 1.1 の初期値で組む設定。付録 B) で組んでいます。フォントは Kumiori の既定 (和文は Noto Serif JP・Noto Sans JP、欧文は Tinos・Arimo、等幅は Cousine) です。仕様の原文は、2026-11-06 に取得した W3C の勧告と勧告候補 (MathML Core) から引用しています (付録 C)。</fo:block>

      <!-- ──────────────── 2 ページの組み立て -->
      <fo:block id="ch-pages" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">ページの組み立て</fo:marker><!--tab:2--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="15.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">2</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="15.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">2</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">2</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">ページの組み立て</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">ページの大きさと領域の配置は、fo:layout-master-set の中で決めます。この章の項目は、流し込む中身 (fo:flow) の中には書けないので、見本の代わりにこの文書そのものの組み立てを示します。</fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-2-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.1　</fo:inline>fo:simple-page-master・fo:region-body ほか<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:simple-page-master is used in the generation of pages and specifies the geometry of the page. The page is subdivided into regions: one or more region-body, and up to four other regions: region-before, region-after, region-start, and region-end.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.4.13</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">この文書の本文は、のどと小口の位置を左右で入れ替えた 2 種類のページマスター (odd・even) で組んでいます。どちらも region-after (ノンブルと、章または文書の名前) を持ち、小口の側に <fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-end</fo:inline> (奇数ページ) か <fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-start</fo:inline> (偶数ページ) を置いて、章のツメを出しています。小口の側の余白は 0 にし、本文の余白は region-body の margin で取っています。12 章のページマスターは、region-body に column-count="2" を付けて 2 段にしています。</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-width</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.15)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの幅を、媒体 (紙) の大きさから決めます。媒体の情報が無ければ、処理系が決めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">indefinite</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの幅を、組んだ内容の大きさから決めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの幅を、指定した長さにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-height</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.13)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの高さを、媒体 (紙) の大きさから決めます。媒体の情報が無ければ、処理系が決めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">indefinite</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの高さを、組んだ内容の大きさから決めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの高さを、指定した長さにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">precedence</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.16)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>このリージョンは隣のリージョンの分だけ短くなり、ページの角まで延びません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>このリージョンを、コンテンツ領域の端から端まで延ばし、四隅の部分もこのリージョンに含めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: region-before・region-after に付けたときだけ解釈します</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-1-->
<fo:block id="s-2-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.2　</fo:inline>fo:page-sequence-master<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:page-sequence-master is used to specify the constraints on and the order in which a given set of page-masters will be used in generating a sequence of pages.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.4.8</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">fo:repeatable-page-master-alternatives と fo:conditional-page-master-reference の odd-or-even で、奇数ページと偶数ページに別の型を当てています。page-position (first・last・only・rest)、blank-or-not-blank、maximum-repeats、fo:single-page-master-reference、fo:repeatable-page-master-reference にも対応します。</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-position</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.14)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">only</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページシーケンスに 1 ページしかないとき (最初で最後のページ)、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">first</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページシーケンスの最初のページのとき、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">last</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページシーケンスの最後のページのとき、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rest</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最初でも最後でもないページのとき、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">any</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの位置によらず、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">odd-or-even</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.12)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">odd</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ノンブル (folio number) が奇数のとき、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">even</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ノンブルが偶数のとき、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">any</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ノンブルの偶奇によらず、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">blank-or-not-blank</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">blank</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>偶奇を合わせるためなどで作る、本文のフロー (fo:flow) の中身が載らないページのとき、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">not-blank</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>本文のフローの中身が載るページのとき、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">any</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>いつでも、このページマスターを選べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">maximum-repeats</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.10)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">no-limit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>この部分で作るページの数に上限を設けません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>この部分で作るページの数の上限です。0 なら、この参照は使いません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-2-->
<fo:block id="s-2-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.3　</fo:inline>fo:static-content・fo:marker・fo:retrieve-marker<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:marker is used in conjunction with fo:retrieve-marker or fo:retrieve-table-marker to produce running headers or footers and dynamic table headers or footers.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.13.5</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">奇数ページの下の右には、章の見出しに置いた fo:marker を fo:retrieve-marker で取り出して、章の名前とノンブル (fo:page-number) を出しています (retrieve-position="first-including-carryover")。偶数ページの下の左はノンブルと文書の名前です。章のツメも、章の見出しの fo:marker を、小口の側の fo:static-content (<fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-end</fo:inline>・<fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-start</fo:inline>) で取り出したものです。fo:marker の中身は、章の番号に応じて上の余白を変えたブロックです。目次は format="i" でローマ数字のノンブルにしています。</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">retrieve-position</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.25.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">first-starting-within-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>そのページで始まる領域に付いたマーカーのうち、最初のものを取り出します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">first-including-carryover</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>前のページから続く領域も含めて、そのページにかかる領域に付いたマーカーのうち、最初のものを取り出します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">last-starting-within-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>そのページで始まる領域に付いたマーカーのうち、最後のものを取り出します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">last-ending-within-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>そのページで終わる領域に付いたマーカーのうち、最後のものを取り出します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">retrieve-boundary</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.25.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>そのページにあるマーカーだけを取り出せます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-sequence</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>同じ fo:page-sequence の中のマーカーだけを取り出せます (前のページから持ち越せます)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">document</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の中のどのマーカーも取り出せます (前の fo:page-sequence からも持ち越せます)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-3-->
<fo:block id="s-2-4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.4　</fo:inline>fo:bookmark-tree<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:bookmark-tree formatting object is used to hold a list of access points within the document such as a table of contents, a list of figures or tables, etc. Each access point is called a bookmark.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.11.1</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">この文書の PDF には、章と節ごとのしおりが付いています。目次の項目は fo:basic-link で各章へ飛べるようにし、ページ番号は fo:page-number-citation で引いています。</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-4--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">starting-state</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.10)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">show</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最初から中身を表示します (しおりでは、子のしおりを開いた状態にします)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hide</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最初は中身を表示しません (しおりでは、子のしおりを閉じた状態にします)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">internal-destination</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.8)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の中のリンク先を持ちません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;idref&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の中の、その id を持つ要素をリンク先にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">external-destination</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.6)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の外のリンク先を持ちません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;uri-specification&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の外のリソース (URI) をリンク先にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応 (fo:bookmark では解釈しません。fo:basic-link では対応。§4.3)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-4-->
<!-- ──────────────── 3 ブロック -->
      <fo:block id="ch-block" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">ブロック</fo:marker><!--tab:3--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="30.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">3</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="30.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">3</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">3</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">ブロック</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-3-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">3.1　</fo:inline>fo:block<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:block formatting object is commonly used for formatting paragraphs, titles, headlines, figure and table captions, etc.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.5.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">余白 (margin・space-before・space-after・start-indent・end-indent)、罫線 (border: solid・dashed・dotted・double・groove・ridge・inset・outset)、内側の余白 (padding)、背景の色と画像、字下げ (text-indent) に対応します。space-before と space-after は、仕様の規則 (§4.3) で隣どうしを重ね合わせます。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-3-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">space-before</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.11.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;space&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ブロックの前のアキの最小・最適・最大の値と、ページの切れ目で捨てるか (conditionality)、隣のアキとの重ね方の優先度 (precedence) を指定します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: .minimum と .maximum は使いません</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-indent</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.11)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最初の行の字下げを、指定した長さにします。負の値にすると、最初の行が前に突き出します (ぶら下げインデント)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最初の行の字下げを、包含ブロックの幅に対する割合で指定します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-before-style</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.8.8 (値は §7.8.20))</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>罫線を引きません (罫線の太さは 0 になります)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hidden</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>none と同じですが、表の罫線の重ね合わせでは、ほかの罫線を消します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dotted</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>点を並べた罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dashed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>短い線分を並べた罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">solid</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>1 本の実線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">double</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>2 本の実線にします。2 本の線とその間の和が、罫線の太さになります。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">groove</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>面に彫り込んだように見える罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ridge</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>groove の逆で、面から盛り上がったように見える罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ボックス全体が面に埋め込まれたように見える罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>inset の逆で、ボックス全体が面から浮き出たように見える罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">background-color</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.8.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">transparent</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>背景を塗らず、下の色が透けて見えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>背景をその色で塗ります。XSL では rgb-icc() 関数も使えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-3-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="block-box" mark="border=&quot;1.5pt double #1f3a5f&quot;|padding=&quot;6pt&quot;|text-indent=&quot;1em&quot;|margin-left=&quot;12mm&quot;|border-start-style=&quot;solid&quot;|padding-start=&quot;6pt&quot;"?>
<fo:block space-before="4pt" padding="6pt" border="1.5pt double #1f3a5f"
    background-color="#eef2f8" text-indent="1em">
  二重の罫線と内側の余白を持つ段落です。字下げは 1em です。
</fo:block>
<fo:block space-before="8pt" margin-left="12mm" border-start-style="solid"
    border-start-width="3pt" border-start-color="#b5562b" padding-start="6pt">
  左に 12mm 下げ、左側だけに罫線を引いた段落です。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-3-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">3.2　</fo:inline>fo:block-container (縦書き)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:block-container flow object is used to generate a block-level reference-area, typically containing text blocks with a different writing-mode. In addition, it can also be used with a different reference-orientation to rotate its content.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.5.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“tb-rl: Inline components and text within a line are written top-to-bottom. Lines and blocks are placed right-to-left.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.29.7 "writing-mode"</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">writing-mode="tb-rl" の縦書きでは、和字を立てて組み、欧字は横に倒します。縦書き用の字形 (OpenType の vert) を使い、句読点や括弧は縦書きの形になります。max-width (XSL 1.1 §7.15.9) は fo:block-container でだけ解釈し、width の指定が無いときに内容の幅の上限にします。min-width・max-height は解釈しません (第 13 章)。</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">writing-mode="rl-tb" (右から左の横書き) で、アラビア語・ヘブライ語などの右から左に書く言語に対応しています。ヘブライ文字・アラビア文字の行は、Unicode の双方向アルゴリズム (UAX #9) の規則で字を並べ替えます (数字や欧文との混在、括弧の鏡像、fo:bidi-override による埋め込みと上書きを含みます)。アラビア文字は、前後の字につながる形 (語頭形・語中形・語尾形・独立形と必須の合字) にします。アラビア文字を持つ書体が必要です (Kumiori の既定の書体は持たないので、コマンドの --font やライブラリの fonts で渡します)。段落の中の一部にアラビア語を混ぜることも、アラビア語の段落に数字や欧文を混ぜることもできます。</fo:block>
      <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:external-graphic src="images/arabic-sample.png" content-width="100mm" border="0.3pt solid #cfd4d2"/></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.5" color="#3b4245" space-after="3mm">アラビア語の組版例 (Noto Naskh Arabic を --font で渡して組んだもの)。1 段落目は writing-mode="rl-tb" のアラビア語の段落 (数字と欧文、括弧を含む)、2 段落目は欧文の中のアラビア語、3 段落目は日本語の中のアラビア語</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-3-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">writing-mode</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.29.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を左から右へ書き、行とブロックを上から下へ積みます (欧文の普通の横書き)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rl-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を右から左へ書き、行とブロックを上から下へ積みます (アラビア語・ヘブライ語の横書き)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb-rl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を上から下へ書き、行とブロックを右から左へ積みます (日本語・中国語の縦書き)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb-lr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を上から下へ書き、行とブロックを左から右へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bt-lr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を下から上へ書き、行とブロックを左から右へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 横向きに組む欧文の字の向きは、上から下のまま</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bt-rl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を下から上へ書き、行とブロックを右から左へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 横向きに組む欧文の字の向きは、上から下のまま</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を左から右へ書き、行とブロックを下から上へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rl-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の中を右から左へ書き、行とブロックを下から上へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-alternating-rl-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>奇数行は左から右、偶数行は右から左へ交互に書き、行とブロックを下から上へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-alternating-rl-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>奇数行は左から右、偶数行は右から左へ交互に書き、行とブロックを上から下へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-inverting-rl-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>奇数行は左から右、偶数行は字を反転して右から左へ書き、行とブロックを下から上へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-inverting-rl-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>奇数行は左から右、偶数行は字を反転して右から左へ書き、行とブロックを上から下へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb-lr-in-lr-pairs</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>2 字ずつ左から右に組んだ対を上から下へ積んで行にし、行とブロックを左から右へ積みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 2 字の組は縦中横で組み、1em に収める (全角の 2 字は縮む)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>lr-tb の短い書き方です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>rl-tb の短い書き方です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>tb-rl の短い書き方です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">display-align</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.14.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>relative-align を使える要素ならそれに従い、そうでなければ before と同じにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">before</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、参照領域の before 側 (横書きでは上、縦書きでは右) に寄せます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">center</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、参照領域の block 方向の中央に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">after</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、参照領域の after 側 (横書きでは下、縦書きでは左) に寄せます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-3-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="vertical" mark="writing-mode=&quot;tb-rl&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container writing-mode="tb-rl" height="36mm" width="100%"
    border="0.6pt solid #9fb0cc" padding="4pt">
  <fo:block>縦書きの段落です。「かぎ括弧」や、句読点の形が縦書き用に変わります。</fo:block>
  <fo:block>欧字の Kumiori や 2026 は横に倒し、漢数字の二〇二六は縦に並びます。</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-3-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">3.3　</fo:inline>reference-orientation (回転)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : 0 | 90 | 180 | 270 | -90 | -180 | -270 | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : 0　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(reference-orientation — XSL 1.1 §7.21.3)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“90: The reference-orientation of this reference-area is rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise from the reference-orientation of the containing reference-area.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.21.3</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-3-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">reference-orientation</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.21.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">0</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>包含する参照領域と同じ向きにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">90</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>包含する参照領域から、反時計回りに 90 度回します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">180</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>包含する参照領域から、反時計回りに 180 度回します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">270</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>包含する参照領域から、反時計回りに 270 度回します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">-90</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>反時計回りに 270 度回します (270 と同じです)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">-180</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>反時計回りに 180 度回します (180 と同じです)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">-270</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>反時計回りに 90 度回します (90 と同じです)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-3-3-->
<?kumiori-sample id="rotate" mark="reference-orientation=&quot;90&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container reference-orientation="90" width="20mm" height="34mm"
    background-color="#fdf3e2" border="0.6pt solid #b5562b" padding="3pt">
  <fo:block font-family="sans-serif">90 度回した箱の中身です。</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 4 行の中の要素 -->
      <fo:block id="ch-inline" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">行の中の要素</fo:marker><!--tab:4--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="45.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">4</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="45.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">4</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">4</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">行の中の要素</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-4-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.1　</fo:inline>fo:inline・baseline-shift<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : baseline | sub | super | &lt;percentage&gt; | &lt;length&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : baseline　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(baseline-shift — XSL 1.1 §7.14.3)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:inline formatting object is commonly used for formatting a portion of text with a background or enclosing it in a border.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.7</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The "baseline-shift" property allows repositioning of the dominant-baseline relative to the dominant-baseline of the parent area. The shifted object might be a subscript or superscript.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.14.3</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">baseline-shift</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.14.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">baseline</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ベースラインを動かしません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">sub</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>フォントの情報から決まる下付き文字の位置へ、ベースラインを下げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: フォントの情報は使わず、フォントサイズの 0.2 倍だけ下げます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">super</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>フォントの情報から決まる上付き文字の位置へ、ベースラインを上げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: フォントの情報は使わず、フォントサイズの 0.35 倍だけ上げます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>親の領域の line-height に対する割合だけ、ベースラインを動かします (正の値で上へ)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>指定した長さだけ、ベースラインを動かします (正の値で上へ)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="inline" mark="&lt;fo:inline|baseline-shift=&quot;super&quot;|baseline-shift=&quot;sub&quot;"?>
<fo:block>文の中の<fo:inline background-color="#fff1b8">背景</fo:inline>、<fo:inline
    border="0.8pt solid #1f3a5f" padding="0 2pt">囲み</fo:inline>、<fo:inline
    font-weight="bold" color="#b5562b">太字と色</fo:inline>、<fo:inline
    text-decoration="underline">下線</fo:inline>。上付きの E = mc<fo:inline
    baseline-shift="super" font-size="70%">2</fo:inline>、下付きの H<fo:inline
    baseline-shift="sub" font-size="70%">2</fo:inline>O。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-4-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.2　</fo:inline>fo:leader<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:leader formatting object is often used: in table-of-contents to generate sequences of "." glyphs that separate titles from page numbers”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.9</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">leader-pattern の space・dots・rule・use-content に対応します。dots と use-content は leader-pattern-width の間隔でそろえて並べます。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">leader-pattern</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">space</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーを空白で埋めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rule</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーを罫線で埋めます。罫線の形は rule-thickness と rule-style で決めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dots</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーを点の繰り返しで埋めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">use-content</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーを、fo:leader の中身の繰り返しで埋めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 中身の字だけを繰り返します</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">leader-length</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length-range&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーの長さの最小・最適・最大を指定します。リーダーの長さはこの範囲に収めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーの長さを、親の領域の内容の幅に対する割合で指定します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rule-style</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>罫線を引きません (rule-thickness は 0 になります)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dotted</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>点を並べた罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dashed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>短い線分を並べた罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">solid</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>1 本の線分にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">double</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>2 本の実線にします。2 本の線とその間の和が rule-thickness になります。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">groove</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>面に彫り込んだように見える罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ridge</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>groove の逆で、面から盛り上がったように見える罫線にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">leader-alignment</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーの模様を、特に揃えません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">reference-area</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーの模様を、参照領域の内容の start 側の端から始まったものとして揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リーダーの模様を、ページの start 側の端から始まったものとして揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="leader" mark="leader-pattern=&quot;dots&quot;|leader-pattern=&quot;rule&quot;|leader-pattern=&quot;use-content&quot;"?>
<fo:block text-align-last="justify">第 1 章 はじめに
  <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots"/> 1</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align-last="justify">第 2 章 ページの組み立て
  <fo:leader leader-pattern="rule" rule-thickness="0.5pt"
      rule-style="dashed"/> 2</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align-last="justify">第 3 章 ブロック
  <fo:leader leader-pattern="use-content">・</fo:leader> 3</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-4-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.3　</fo:inline>fo:page-number・fo:page-number-citation・fo:basic-link<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:page-number-citation is used to reference the page-number for the page containing the first normal area returned by the cited formatting object.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.11</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">fo:page-number-citation-last (引いた要素の最後のページ) にも対応します。fo:basic-link は文書の中へのリンク先 (internal-destination) と、外の URI (external-destination) の両方を PDF のリンクにします。外へのリンク (fo:bookmark の external-destination も) は、既定では、スキームが http・https・mailto・tel の URL と、相対参照の PDF だけをリンクにします。ほかのスキーム (javascript:・file: など) と、ファイルを開く動作 (PDF でない相対のファイル・絶対パス) は、リンクにせずに字だけを組み、警告に知らせます (API の links、コマンドの --link-schemes・--link-launch で選べます)。下の見本では、この段落自身への参照と、W3C の仕様書へのリンクを置いています。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ref-id</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.30.13)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;idref&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>フォーマッティングオブジェクトのツリーの中で、その id を持つ要素を指します (fo:page-number-citation では、その要素のページ番号を引きます)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">internal-destination</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.8)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の中のリンク先を持ちません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;idref&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の中の、その id を持つ要素をリンク先にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">external-destination</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.6)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の外のリンク先を持ちません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;uri-specification&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文書の外のリソース (URI) をリンク先にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">show-destination</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.9)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">replace</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>今の文書の表示を、リンク先で置き換えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">new</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>リンク先を、新しいウィンドウで開きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-3-->
<?kumiori-sample id="citation" mark="&lt;fo:page-number/&gt;|&lt;fo:page-number-citation ref-id=&quot;here&quot;/&gt;|internal-destination=&quot;here&quot;|external-destination"?>
<fo:block id="here">この段落は <fo:page-number/> ページにあります。<fo:basic-link
    internal-destination="here" color="#1f3a5f"
    text-decoration="underline">この段落</fo:basic-link>への参照:
  <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="here"/> ページ。外へのリンク: <fo:basic-link
    external-destination="url('https://www.w3.org/TR/xsl11/')" color="#1f3a5f"
    text-decoration="underline">XSL 1.1</fo:basic-link>。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-4-4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.4　</fo:inline>fo:character・fo:bidi-override<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:bidi-override formatting object is used when the Unicode BIDI algorithm fails. It forces a string of text to be written in a specific direction.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.2</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-4--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">character</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.17.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;character&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>表示する Unicode の文字を指定します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">unicode-bidi</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.29.6)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>双方向アルゴリズムで、新しい埋め込みレベルを作りません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">embed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>埋め込みレベルを 1 つ作ります (向きは direction で決まります)。中では、暗黙の並べ替えをします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bidi-override</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中の字を、暗黙の並べ替えをせず、direction の向きにそのまま並べます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">direction</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.29.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ltr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>左から右の向きにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rtl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>右から左の向きにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-4-->
<?kumiori-sample id="character" mark="character=&quot;★&quot;|character=&quot;§&quot;|direction=&quot;rtl&quot;|unicode-bidi=&quot;bidi-override&quot;"?>
<fo:block>fo:character で置いた字: <fo:character character="★" color="#b5562b"/><fo:character
    character="§"/>。向きを逆にした字の並び: <fo:bidi-override direction="rtl"
    unicode-bidi="bidi-override">ABC 123</fo:bidi-override>。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 5 文字と行 -->
      <fo:block id="ch-text" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">文字と行</fo:marker><!--tab:5--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="60.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">5</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="60.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">5</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">5</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">文字と行</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-5-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.1　</fo:inline>フォントのプロパティ (font-family・font-size・font-weight・font-style)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">font-family には、フォント名と総称 (serif・sans-serif・monospace) を並べられます。Kumiori は並びの中から、読み込んだフォントか、名前から見分けた明朝系・ゴシック系・等幅のフォントを 1 つ選びます。そのフォントに無い文字は、Kumiori の既定のフォントで組みます (並びの後ろのフォントへは移りません)。font-style="italic" は、斜体のフォントが無ければ字を傾けて描きます。明朝系 (serif と指定の無いもの) の和字の太字は、太字のある Noto Sans JP Bold (ゴシック体) で組みます。等幅の和字のように太字のフォントが無いときは、字の輪郭を太くします。</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">異体字セレクタ (U+FE00〜FE0F、U+E0100〜E01EF) は、直前の字と合わせて 1 つの字として組み、フォントが持つ異体字の並び (OpenType の cmap の Format 14) の字形を選びます (IVS・SVS。「葛」に U+E0100 を続けた並びなど)。フォントにその並びが無ければ、もとの字の字形で組みます。禁則・字の間・縦書きの字の向きは、もとの字で決まります。</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">基底の字に結合文字が続く並び (e に U+0301、「か」に U+3099 の濁点など) と、絵文字の並び (肌の色の修飾、ZWJ でつなぐ並び、国旗、キーキャップ) も、1 つの字 (UAX #29 の拡張書記素クラスタ) として組みます。並び全体を 1 つのフォントに渡すので、フォントの位置合わせ (GPOS の mark) と字形の置き換え (GSUB) が効きます。並びの途中では、改行せず、字間 (letter-spacing) も両端揃えの空きも入れません。並びを持つフォントが無ければ、合成済みの 1 字 (NFC) に置き換えられるときはその字で、できなければ字ごとの字形で組みます。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-family</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;family-name&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>使いたいフォントファミリーの名前です。並びの先頭から順に、字を持つフォントを探します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 読み込んだフォント名に合わなければ、名前から明朝系・ゴシック系・等幅を見分けて、組み込みのフォントで組みます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;generic-family&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>総称のフォント名 (serif・sans-serif・cursive・fantasy・monospace) です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: serif・sans-serif・monospace を見分けます。cursive・fantasy は見分けません</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-size</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;absolute-size&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>処理系の持つ大きさの表の項目 (xx-small〜xx-large) で指定します。隣どうしは 1.2 倍が推奨です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;relative-size&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>親のフォントサイズから、表の 1 段上 (larger) か下 (smaller) にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>フォントサイズを、指定した長さにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>親のフォントサイズに対する割合で指定します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-weight</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.9)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>400 と同じです。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bold</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>700 と同じです。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bolder</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>受け継いだ太さより 1 段太い太さにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 親の太さによらず bold にします</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lighter</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>受け継いだ太さより 1 段細い太さにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 親の太さによらず normal にします</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">100〜900</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>太さを数で指定します。数が大きいほど、少なくとも同じか太いフォントになります。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: フォントは 600 以上を太字、それより小さい値を標準の太さとして選びます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-style</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>標準 (normal) のフォントを使います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">italic</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>イタリックのフォントを使います。無ければ oblique のフォントを使います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">oblique</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>oblique (斜体) のフォントを使います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: italic と同じに扱います</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">backslant</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>逆に傾いた (backslant) フォントを使います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="fonts" mark="font-family=&quot;serif&quot;|font-family=&quot;sans-serif&quot;|font-family=&quot;monospace&quot;|font-size=&quot;14pt&quot;|font-weight=&quot;bold&quot;|font-style=&quot;italic&quot;"?>
<fo:block font-family="serif">明朝体 (serif) の段落。Serif の欧文。</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif">ゴシック体 (sans-serif) の段落。Sans-serif.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="monospace">等幅 (monospace): if (a &lt; b) return;</fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold">14pt の太字</fo:block>
<fo:block font-style="italic">斜体 (italic) の Italic text</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.2　</fo:inline>text-align・text-align-last<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : start | center | end | justify | inside | outside | left | right | &lt;string&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : start　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(text-align — XSL 1.1 §7.16.9)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : relative | start | center | end | justify | inside | outside | left | right | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : relative　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(text-align-last — XSL 1.1 §7.16.10)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“relative: If text-align is justify, then the alignment of the last line, and of any line ending in U+000A, will be start.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.16.10</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">和文の両端そろえは、JLREQ (§3.8 行の調整処理) に従い、まず約物のアキを詰め、足りなければ字の間を広げます。行頭・行末の禁則 (句読点や閉じ括弧を行頭に置かない) も守ります。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-align</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.9)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、行の進む方向の start 側に揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">center</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、行の進む方向の中央に揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、行の進む方向の end 側に揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">justify</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を広げて、使える幅いっぱいにします (両端揃え)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの綴じ側が start 側なら start、end 側なら end に揃えます。どちらでもなければ start にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 奇数ページは綴じ側を start 側、偶数ページは end 側とみなして決めます (互換モードでも同じ)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの綴じ側が start 側なら end、end 側なら start に揃えます。どちらでもなければ end にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 奇数ページは綴じ側を start 側、偶数ページは end 側とみなして決めます (互換モードでも同じ)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>text-align="start" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応 (互換モードでは物理の左・右に寄せます)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>text-align="end" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応 (互換モードでは物理の左・右に寄せます)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>表のセルの中身を、その文字列の位置で列に揃えます。表のセルの中でなければ start として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-align-last</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.10)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">relative</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>text-align が justify なら、最後の行 (と改行 U+000A で終わる行) を start に揃えます。そうでなければ text-align と同じにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最後の行を start 側に揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">center</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最後の行を中央に揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最後の行を end 側に揃えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">justify</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>最後の行も、使える幅いっぱいに広げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの綴じ側が start 側なら start、end 側なら end に揃えます。どちらでもなければ start にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 仕様モードでは綴じ側 (奇数ページは start 側、偶数ページは end 側) で決めます。互換モードではいつも start にします</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの綴じ側が start 側なら end、end 側なら start に揃えます。どちらでもなければ end にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 仕様モードでは綴じ側 (奇数ページは start 側、偶数ページは end 側) で決めます。互換モードではいつも start にします</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>text-align-last="start" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応 (互換モードでは物理の左・右に寄せます)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>text-align-last="end" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応 (互換モードでは物理の左・右に寄せます)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="align" mark="text-align=&quot;justify&quot;|text-align=&quot;center&quot;|text-align=&quot;end&quot;|text-align-last=&quot;justify&quot;"?>
<fo:block text-align="justify" border="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3" padding="3pt">両端そろえ
  (justify) の段落です。行の終わりがそろうように、字の間を調整します。最後の行は
  text-align-last の初期値 relative により、行頭にそろいます。</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="center" space-before="3pt">中央そろえ (center)</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="end">行末そろえ (end)</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="justify" text-align-last="justify"
    space-before="3pt">最後の行も両端にそろえる</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.3　</fo:inline>letter-spacing・line-height<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : normal | &lt;length&gt; | &lt;space&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : normal　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(letter-spacing — XSL 1.1 §7.17.2)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : normal | &lt;length&gt; | &lt;number&gt; | &lt;percentage&gt; | &lt;space&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : normal　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(line-height — XSL 1.1 §7.16.4)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“This property specifies spacing behavior between text characters.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.17.2</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">letter-spacing</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.17.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>フォントの普通の字間にします。両端揃えのために、処理系が字間を変えてもかまいません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>普通の字間に、指定した長さを足します。両端揃えのために字間をそれ以上変えません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;space&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>足す字間の最小・最適・最大を指定し、その範囲で字間を調整できます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: .optimum と .maximum だけを使います</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">line-height</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>文字サイズから処理系が決める「妥当な」値にします。仕様は 1.0〜1.2 を推奨しています。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の高さを、指定した長さにします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>要素のフォントサイズに、その数を掛けた値にします。子には数のまま受け継がれます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>要素のフォントサイズに、その割合を掛けた値にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;space&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の高さの最小・最適・最大と、conditionality・precedence を指定します (半行間を決めるのに使います)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-3-->
<?kumiori-sample id="spacing" mark="letter-spacing=&quot;0.3em&quot;|line-height=&quot;1.2&quot;|line-height=&quot;2.2&quot;"?>
<fo:block letter-spacing="0.3em">字と字の間を広く空けた行です</fo:block>
<fo:block line-height="1.2" space-before="3pt" background-color="#eef2f8"
    margin-right="50mm">行と行の間が詰まる、行送り 1.2
  の段落です。二行目を見ると、行の間の違いが分かります。</fo:block>
<fo:block line-height="2.2" space-before="3pt" background-color="#fdf3e2"
    margin-right="50mm">行と行の間が広がる、行送り 2.2
  の段落です。二行目を見ると、行の間の違いが分かります。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.4　</fo:inline>hyphenate (欧文のハイフネーション)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : false | true | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : false　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(hyphenate — XSL 1.1 §7.10.4)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“true: Hyphenation may be used in the line-breaking algorithm between characters with this value.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.10.4</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">ハイフネーションの規則は language (xml:lang) で選びます。Kumiori が持つ規則は、英語 (en-US・en-GB) とラテン語 (la) です。ほかの言語の語はハイフネーションしません。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-4--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hyphenate</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.10.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行分割で、ハイフネーションを行いません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行分けで、ハイフネーションを使ってかまいません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 英語 (en・en-US・en-GB) とラテン語 (la) の規則だけを持ちます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-4-->
<?kumiori-sample id="hyphenate" mark="hyphenate=&quot;true&quot;|xml:lang=&quot;en&quot;"?>
<fo:block xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true" text-align="justify" width="60mm"
    margin-right="60mm" font-family="serif">
  Typesetting engines must balance typographic considerations such as
  justification, hyphenation, and internationalization requirements.
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-5" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.5　</fo:inline>linefeed-treatment・white-space の扱い<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : ignore | preserve | treat-as-space | treat-as-zero-width-space | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : treat-as-space　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(linefeed-treatment — XSL 1.1 §7.16.7)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“ignore: Specifies that any character flow object whose Unicode code point is U+000A shall be discarded during the refinement process.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.16.7</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">この文書の見本のコードの表示は、linefeed-treatment="preserve" と white-space-collapse="false" で、原稿の改行と字下げをそのまま残しています。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-5--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">linefeed-treatment</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>改行 (U+000A) を捨てます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">preserve</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>改行に何もしません (改行として残します)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">treat-as-space</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>改行を空白 (U+0020) に変えます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">treat-as-zero-width-space</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>改行を幅の無い空白 (U+200B) に変えます。行分けの位置にはなりますが、同じ行では間を空けません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">white-space-treatment</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.8)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>改行 (U+000A) を除く XML の空白を、行を組むときに消します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">preserve</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>XML の空白を消しません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore-if-before-linefeed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の最後になる、消してよい空白を消します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore-if-after-linefeed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の最初になる、消してよい空白を消します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore-if-surrounding-linefeed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行の最初か最後になる、消してよい空白を消します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">white-space-collapse</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.12)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>空白に何もしません (続く空白もそのまま残します)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>空白の直前が空白か、直後が改行なら、その空白を出しません (続く空白を 1 つにまとめます)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">white-space</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.31.23)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>linefeed-treatment="treat-as-space"・white-space-collapse="true"・white-space-treatment="ignore-if-surrounding-linefeed"・wrap-option="wrap" の略記です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pre</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>linefeed-treatment="preserve"・white-space-collapse="false"・white-space-treatment="preserve"・wrap-option="no-wrap" の略記です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">nowrap</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>normal と同じ空白の扱いで、wrap-option="no-wrap" にする略記です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-5-->
<?kumiori-sample id="linefeed" mark="linefeed-treatment=&quot;preserve&quot;|white-space-collapse=&quot;false&quot;|white-space-treatment=&quot;preserve&quot;"?>
<fo:block linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false"
    white-space-treatment="preserve" font-family="monospace" font-size="8pt"
    background-color="#f5f1e8" padding="3pt">一行目
    四つ下げた二行目
三行目</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 6 表 -->
      <fo:block id="ch-table" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">表</fo:marker><!--tab:6--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="75.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">6</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="75.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">6</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">6</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">表</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-6-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">6.1　</fo:inline>fo:table・border-collapse・number-columns-spanned<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : collapse | collapse-with-precedence | separate | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : collapse　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(border-collapse — XSL 1.1 §7.28.3)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : &lt;number&gt;　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : 1　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(number-columns-spanned — XSL 1.1 §7.28.13)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:table flow object is used for formatting the tabular material of a table.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.7.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“collapse: The value "collapse" selects the collapsing borders model.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.28.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">列の幅は固定 (table-layout="fixed") と自動の両方に対応し、proportional-column-width() で残りの幅を比で分けます。表のヘッダー (fo:table-header) と表のフッター (fo:table-footer) は、表がページをまたぐとページごとに繰り返します。罫線は collapse・separate のどちらの組み方にも対応し、collapse では仕様の規則で太い罫線を優先します。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-6-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-collapse</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.28.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">collapse</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>隣り合うセルの罫線を重ね合わせる (collapse) 方式にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">collapse-with-precedence</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>罫線を重ね合わせる方式で、競合する罫線のどちらを使うかを border-*-precedence の値で決めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: collapse として扱います (border-*-precedence を解釈しません)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">separate</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>セルごとに罫線を分けて引く (separate) 方式にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">number-columns-spanned</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.28.13)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>正の整数で、fo:table-cell がいまの列から何列にまたがるかを指定します。正でない値や整数でない値は、1 以上の整数に丸めます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応 (いちばん近い 1 以上の整数にします。2.6 は 3)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-6-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="table" mark="border-collapse=&quot;collapse&quot;|number-columns-spanned=&quot;2&quot;|number-rows-spanned=&quot;2&quot;|proportional-column-width(1)|&lt;fo:table-header"?>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse"
    border="1pt solid #1f3a5f" font-size="8.5pt">
  <fo:table-column column-width="28mm"/>
  <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
  <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
  <fo:table-header background-color="#1f3a5f" color="#ffffff"
      font-family="sans-serif">
    <fo:table-row>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt"><fo:block>形式</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" number-columns-spanned="2">
        <fo:block text-align="center">特徴</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
  </fo:table-header>
  <fo:table-body>
    <fo:table-row>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>PNG</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>可逆の圧縮</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>透明度を持てる</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
    <fo:table-row background-color="#eef2f8">
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc"
          number-rows-spanned="2" display-align="center">
        <fo:block>SVG</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>ベクター</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>拡大しても粗くならない</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
    <fo:table-row background-color="#eef2f8">
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc"
          number-columns-spanned="2">
        <fo:block>グラデーション・切り抜き・模様・字を描ける</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
  </fo:table-body>
</fo:table>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-6-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">6.2　</fo:inline>fo:table-and-caption<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:table-and-caption flow object is used for formatting a table together with its caption.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.7.2</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-6-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">caption-side</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.28.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">before</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の前 (block 方向の前) に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">after</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の後 (block 方向の後) に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の inline 方向の前 (横書きでは左) に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 表の前 (block 方向) に置きます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の inline 方向の後 (横書きでは右) に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 表の後 (block 方向) に置きます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">top</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の上に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: before と同じに扱います</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bottom</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の下に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の左に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>キャプションを、表の右に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-6-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="table-caption" mark="&lt;fo:table-and-caption|caption-side=&quot;after&quot;|&lt;fo:table-caption&gt;"?>
<fo:table-and-caption caption-side="after" text-align="center">
  <fo:table-caption>
    <fo:block font-size="8pt" color="#4a443c"
        space-before="2pt">表 1　列の幅は比で分ける</fo:block>
  </fo:table-caption>
  <fo:table width="70%" margin-left="15%" border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f">
    <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
    <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
    <fo:table-body>
      <fo:table-row>
        <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.4pt solid #9fb0cc">
          <fo:block>1</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
        <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.4pt solid #9fb0cc">
          <fo:block>2</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      </fo:table-row>
    </fo:table-body>
  </fo:table>
</fo:table-and-caption>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 7 リスト -->
      <fo:block id="ch-list" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">リスト</fo:marker><!--tab:7--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="90.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">7</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="90.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">7</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">7</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">リスト</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-7-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">7.1　</fo:inline>fo:list-block・provisional-distance-between-starts<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 値</fo:inline> : &lt;length&gt; | &lt;percentage&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 初期値</fo:inline> : 24.0pt　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● 継承</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(provisional-distance-between-starts — XSL 1.1 §7.30.12)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:list-block flow object is used to format a list.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.8.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:list-item formatting object contains the label and the body of an item in a list.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.8.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <?kumiori-sample id="list" mark="provisional-distance-between-starts=&quot;9mm&quot;|provisional-distance-between-starts=&quot;5mm&quot;|provisional-label-separation=&quot;2mm&quot;|label-end()|body-start()"?>
<fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="9mm"
    provisional-label-separation="2mm">
  <fo:list-item>
    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
      <fo:block text-align="end" color="#b5562b">(1)</fo:block></fo:list-item-label>
    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
      <fo:block>一つ目の項目。本文が長くなって行を折り返すと、二行目以降もラベルの幅の分だけ下がった本文の左端にそろいます。</fo:block></fo:list-item-body>
  </fo:list-item>
  <fo:list-item space-before="2pt">
    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
      <fo:block text-align="end" color="#b5562b">(2)</fo:block></fo:list-item-label>
    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
      <fo:block>二つ目の項目には、入れ子のリストがあります。</fo:block>
      <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="5mm">
        <fo:list-item>
          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
            <fo:block>・</fo:block></fo:list-item-label>
          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
            <fo:block>入れ子の項目</fo:block></fo:list-item-body>
        </fo:list-item>
      </fo:list-block>
    </fo:list-item-body>
  </fo:list-item>
</fo:list-block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">項目のラベル (fo:list-item-label) と本文 (fo:list-item-body) の位置は、label-end() と body-start() の関数で決めます。入れ子のリストにも対応します。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-7-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">provisional-distance-between-starts</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.30.12)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ラベルの始端から本体の始端までの仮の距離を、長さで指定します。body-start() の計算に使います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>その距離を、いちばん近い祖先のブロックの領域の幅に対する割合で指定します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-7-1-->

      <!-- ──────────────── 8 脚注とフロート -->
      <fo:block id="ch-out" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">脚注とフロート</fo:marker><!--tab:8--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="105.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">8</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="105.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">8</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">8</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">脚注とフロート</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-8-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">8.1　</fo:inline>fo:footnote<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:footnote is typically used to produce footnote-citations within the region-body of a page and the corresponding footnote in a separate area nearer the after-edge of the page.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.12.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">脚注の本文は、参照のあるページの下に置きます。本文と脚注の間の区切りは、flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator" の fo:static-content の中身で描きます。この文書では、fo:leader の 30mm の細い線を置いています (このページの下)。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-8-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">flow-name</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;name&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>フロー (fo:flow・fo:static-content) の名前です。同じ名前のリージョンに中身を流し込みます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">xsl-footnote-separator</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>予約された名前で、この fo:static-content の中身を、脚注の領域の初めに区切りとして置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">xsl-before-float-separator</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>予約された名前で、この fo:static-content の中身を、ページの上に置いたフロート (before-float) の領域の終わりに区切りとして置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-8-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="footnote" mark="&lt;fo:footnote&gt;|&lt;fo:footnote-body&gt;"?>
<fo:block>この文には脚注があります<fo:footnote>
    <fo:inline baseline-shift="super" font-size="70%" color="#b5562b">*1</fo:inline>
    <fo:footnote-body>
      <fo:block font-size="7.5pt"
          color="#4a443c">*1　これはページの下に置かれる脚注の本文です。</fo:block>
    </fo:footnote-body>
  </fo:footnote>。脚注の本文は、このページの下にあります。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-8-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">8.2　</fo:inline>fo:float<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:float formatting object is typically used either to cause an image to be positioned in a separate area at the beginning of a page, or to cause an image to be positioned to one side, with normal content flowing around and along-side the image.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.12.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">float="start" と float="end" は、横に寄せたボックスの周りに本文を回り込ませます。float="before" は、ページの上に置きます。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-8-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">float</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.19.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">before</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>fo:float の中身を、region-body のページの上のフロートの領域 (before-float) に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、参照領域の start 側に寄せて浮かせます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身を、参照領域の end 側に寄せて浮かせます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>float="start" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>float="end" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの綴じ側に寄せて浮かせます (綴じ側が無ければ start 側)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 奇数ページは綴じ側を start 側、偶数ページは end 側とみなして決めます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>ページの綴じ側の反対 (小口側) に寄せて浮かせます (綴じ側が無ければ end 側)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 奇数ページは綴じ側を start 側、偶数ページは end 側とみなして決めます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>浮かせずに、普通の位置に置きます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">clear</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.19.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>前にある start 側のフロート (left・start) の後まで、この領域を下げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>前にある end 側のフロート (right・end) の後まで、この領域を下げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>clear="start" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>clear="end" として扱います。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>前にある inside のフロートの後まで、この領域を下げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>前にある outside のフロートの後まで、この領域を下げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">both</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>前にあるすべての横のフロートの後まで、この領域を下げます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>フロートとの位置の制約を設けません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-8-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="float" mark="float=&quot;end&quot;"?>
<fo:block>
  <fo:float float="end">
    <fo:block-container width="32mm" margin-left="3mm" margin-right="0mm"
        padding="3pt" background-color="#eef2f8" border="0.6pt solid #9fb0cc">
      <fo:block start-indent="0mm" end-indent="0mm" font-size="8pt"
          text-align="center">
        <fo:external-graphic src="images/woven.png" content-width="30mm"/>
        <fo:block>右に寄せたフロート</fo:block>
      </fo:block>
    </fo:block-container>
  </fo:float>
  右に寄せた箱の周りに、本文が回り込みます。箱の高さを過ぎると、本文は元の幅に戻ります。組み織りの名は、組版の「組み」と、布を「織る」ことに由来します。縦の糸と横の糸を組み合わせるように、字と行と段とページを組み合わせて紙面を作ります。回り込みの見本のために、もう少し文を続けます。行の幅は箱の手前で縮み、箱の下では元に戻ります。この段落の終わりの行は、箱の下の広い幅で組まれています。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 9 画像 -->
      <fo:block id="ch-image" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">画像</fo:marker><!--tab:9--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="120.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">9</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="120.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">9</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">9</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">画像</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-9-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">9.1　</fo:inline>fo:external-graphic<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:external-graphic flow object is used for a graphic where the graphics data resides outside of the fo:element tree.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.5</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Kumiori は 11 の形式の画像を解釈します (見本の後の表。WebP は非可逆と可逆の 2 枚の見本を載せています)。下の見本は、どれも同じ絵 (夕暮れの空・星・夕日・山並み・織り目の帯) を、それぞれの形式で書き出したものです。絵は Kumiori のリポジトリの scripts/make-conformance-images.py で描いた自作のもので、ベクターの形式 (SVG・EPS・WMF・EMF・CGM) は、ファイルの中身をそのスクリプトが直接組み立てています。</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-9-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">src</fo:inline> の値の意味 <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.30.16)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;uri-specification&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>中身として取り込む外のリソース (画像など) の場所を、URI で指定します。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-9-1-->
