font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>影を描きません。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>影を箱の外でなく内側に落とします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応 (padding の箱の内側に描きます)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">1 番目・2 番目の &lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>影を横 (正で右) と縦 (正で下) にずらす量です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">3 番目の &lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>影の縁をぼかす幅です (0 以上)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">4 番目の &lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>影を四方に広げる量です (負の値で縮めます)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>影を塗る色です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">,</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>カンマで区切ると、複数の影を重ねられます。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahadd-s-A-1-x14-->
      <fo:block id="s-A-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.2　</fo:inline>axf:diagonal-border・axf:reverse-diagonal-border<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">対応</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:diagonal-border-color は、表のセルに引く対角線の罫の色を指定します。線の種類と太さは axf:diagonal-border-style・axf:diagonal-border-width で指定します。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-diagonal" mark="axf:diagonal-border-style=&quot;solid&quot;|axf:diagonal-border-width=&quot;0.6pt&quot;|axf:diagonal-border-color=&quot;#b5562b&quot;"?>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="60mm" border-collapse="collapse"
    font-size="8pt">
  <fo:table-column column-width="20mm" number-columns-repeated="3"/>
  <fo:table-body>
    <fo:table-row height="10mm">
      <fo:table-cell border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f" axf:diagonal-border-style="solid"
          axf:diagonal-border-width="0.6pt" axf:diagonal-border-color="#b5562b">
        <fo:block/></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f" padding="2pt">
        <fo:block>列 1</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f" padding="2pt">
        <fo:block>列 2</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
  </fo:table-body>
</fo:table>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                        <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-2-x14--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">対角罫 (axf:diagonal-border-*) と逆対角罫 (axf:reverse-diagonal-border-*) は、線種・太さ・色と、一括指定の axf:diagonal-border・axf:reverse-diagonal-border を解釈します。線種が none・hidden のときは引きません。</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:diagonal-border-color</fo:inline> の値の意味</fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対角罫 (表のセルの左上から右下へ引く線) の色です。指定が無ければ color の値です。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>一部: 指定が無いときは、color の値でなく黒で引きます</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:diagonal-border-style</fo:inline> の値の意味</fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="