;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>medium・small・larger などの語で書きます (初期値 medium)。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>未対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-font-style</fo:inline> の値の意味</fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">値</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">意味</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>行番号を立体 (斜体でない字) にします。</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>対応</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4p